  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svenskt st&#xf6;d till avskrivning av Sudans skulder till IMF 2021</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish support for the arrears clearance of Sudan&apos;s debts to IMF 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">.Bidrag till Sudans dr&#xf6;jsm&#xe5;lsklarering i IMF i syfte att n&#xe5; beslutspunkt f&#xf6;r det s.k. HIPC-initiativet. Bidraget ges som en del av en samlad internationell anstr&#xe4;ngning f&#xf6;r att normalisera Sudans relationer med de internationella finansiella institutionerna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">.Contributions to Sudan&#x2019;s arrears clearance process in the IMF in order to help Sudan reaching decision point in the HIPC-initiative. The contribution is part of a joint international effort to normalize Sudan&#x2019;s relations with the international financial institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
